      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Fun Field is the second largest structure in our Play Lands range, with a product area of 44'10\" x 42'9\". It carries a jungle theme in Lemon Yellow and Sea Green, and several towers are joined by tunnels, each with its own slide. Children climb, crawl through, hang and slide without everyone queuing at one point, which matters on a busy evening in a park. With an age group of 3+ and key users from 3 to 12, it suits municipal gardens, large townships and resorts with open ground. The listed capacity is 15 children. Plan for a safe play area of 50'10\" x 49'9\". Galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope on Fun Field come with a 3-year warranty against manufacturing defects. Share a site photo and we will plan the layout."
